BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Fossil Discovery and Geology Hike\, McCormick's Creek State Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260606T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260606T153000
UID:8d68144ee829a011381fb155fe6891ec@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:(Hike) Take a trip back in time to when Indiana was an ocean f
 loor! Learn about ancient creatures from the skeletons they left behind in
  the limestone. Join DNR Kaitlyn on a rugged hike on Trail 3. We will scra
 bble through rocks in the creek to learn about fossils older than dinosaur
 s and how the canyon was formed and altered over geological history. We be
 gin our 0.8-mile hike in front of the Canyon Inn. &nbsp\;
LOCATION:McCormick's Creek State Park\, Canyon Inn\, 250 McCormick's Creek
  Park Road\, Spencer\, IN 47460
URL:on.in.gov/mccormickscreek
X-SOURCE:McCormick's Creek State Park
END:VEVENT
