DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260608T144500
UID:e53bf2a00301e4ae7a65dac89bed4266@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:(Lab) Birds do not have hands or teeth. How do they eat? With 
 their beaks! Birds&rsquo\; beaks have adapted to allow them to be speciali
 sts in their fields. You will put their beak through difficult tasks like 
 finding food. This lab is held in the program room at the Nature Center . 
 &nbsp\;
