UID:355e75815c4e6eb714391353c9113b65@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:(Hike) Learn how to bird while walking with your child in a st
 roller.&nbsp\; This program requires pre-registration by emailing Jfiler@d
 nr.IN.gov .&nbsp\; Descriptions: Hikes and activities are intended for fam
 ilies to build a relationship with nature and encourage environmental awar
 eness from birth. Parents/caregivers will learn new skills to encourage na
 ture learning at home. While these programs are geared for parents/caregiv
 ers with newborns to 3-year-olds\, your whole flock is welcome with their 
 siblings. Hikes are either stroller friendly or require a baby carrier. Pl
 ease register by emailing&nbsp\; Jfiler@dnr.IN.gov &nbsp\;to participate.&
 nbsp\;
LOCATION:McCormick's Creek State Park\, Nature Center\, 250 McCormick's Cr
 eek Park Road\, Spencer\, IN 47460
URL:on.in.gov/mccormickscreek
X-SOURCE:McCormick's Creek State Park
END:VEVENT
