SUMMARY:Lovely Lichen\, McCormick's Creek State Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260615T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260615T110000
UID:86fdc323c89677abb124e6ab85c99949@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:(Hike) On this hike we learn about the symbiotic relationships
  lichen have with the trees they grow on. Lichen powers the food web in ro
 cky environments like on trial 2. We will be hiking in tornado impact area
  to learn about lichen. Meet DNR Volunteer Dinah at Friendly Shelter begin
  this 1-mile hike. &nbsp\;
LOCATION:McCormick's Creek State Park\, Friendly Recreation Shelter Parkin
 g Lot\, 250 McCormick's Creek Park Road\, Spencer\, IN 47460
