  the environment to slow down and connect with the natural world. Babes wi
 ll get sensory time while you get grounded. This program requires pre-regi
 stration by emailing Jfiler@dnr.in.gov . Descriptions: Hikes and activitie
 s are intended for families to build a relationship with nature and encour
 age environmental awareness from birth. Parents/caregivers will learn new 
 skills to encourage nature learning at home. While these programs are gear
 ed for parents/caregivers with newborns to 3-year-olds\, your whole flock 
 is welcome with their siblings. Hikes are either stroller friendly or requ
 ire a baby carrier.&nbsp\;
