SUMMARY:Little Feet and Nature Connections\, McCormick's Creek State Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260730T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260730T110000
UID:52d8a00245cfaae53b8cb5ab34e6c2ea@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:Title: Little Feet and Nature Connections Descriptions: Hikes 
 and activities are intended for families to build a relationship with natu
 re and encourage environmental awareness from birth. Parents/caregivers wi
 ll learn new skills to encourage nature learning at home. While these prog
 rams are geared for parents/caregivers with newborns to 3-year-olds\, your
  whole flock is welcome with their siblings. Hikes are either stroller fri
 endly or require a baby carrier. Please register by emailing&nbsp\; Jfiler
 @dnr.IN.gov &nbsp\;to participate.&nbsp\; July 30 Location: In front of th
 e Canyon Inn 10-11 a.m. Carrier Babes: Wet Toes and Fossils.&nbsp\; Put th
 e whole family in clothes and shoes you don&rsquo\;t mind getting wet. We 
 will take a rugged hike in the creek to look for fossils. Babes will get s
 ensory time trying to dip their toes in the cold water.&nbsp\;
LOCATION:McCormick's Creek State Park\, Canyon Inn\, 250 McCormick's Creek
  Park Road\, Spencer\, IN 47460
URL:on.IN.gov/mccormickscreek
X-SOURCE:McCormick's Creek State Park
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Operation Firewatch
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260731T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260731T160000
UID:3a67e3e8e892782d9c55d72a4892ffbe@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:Some of you are barely hanging on. Some of you are running on 
 empty. And some ofyou&hellip\; have been one bad day away from tapping out
 . We&rsquo\;re not here to sugarcoat it. We&rsquo\;ve buried too many of o
 ur own. It&rsquo\;s time to stop bleeding alone. Operation Firewatch is no
 t a vacation. It&rsquo\;s where warriors stand guard over each other&rsquo
 \;s lives\, stories\, and futures. July 31\, 2026 at 4pm - August 2\, 2026
  at 10am Scholarships available\, please do not let cost prevent youfrom c
 oming.
LOCATION:McCormick's Creek State Park\, 250 McCormick's Creek Park Road\, 
 Spencer\, IN 47460
URL:https://irreverentwarriors.donordrive.com/firewatch26
X-SOURCE:McCormick's Creek State Park
END:VEVENT
